<title>UK: Sumitomo Speciality Metals sets convertible bond.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Speciality Metals sets convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following convertible bond was announced by lead manager Daiwa Europe.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUMITOMO SPECIALITY METALS</p>
<p> AMT    15 BLN YEN    IND COUPON 0.25-0.50 MATURITY    30.SEP.04</p>
<p> TYPE   CONVERTIBLE   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    11.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.5	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (M) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.0	 SELL CONC  1.5	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	CONVERSION PERIOD 26.AUG.97 - 13.SEP.04</p>
<p>		PUT 30.SEP.03 AT PAR</p>
<p>		TAX CALL ANY TIME AT PAR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
